Real outputs captured in cwnsb-lab on 2026-10-01 (Debian 13, btrfs-progs 6.14,
mdadm 4.4, kernel 5.15) by tools/lab/probe-btrfs.sh on a 2-loop RAID1.
Edited for tests: loop3p1 error counters in device-stats.json (real: all 0),
and the degraded md126 RAID5 block in mdstat.txt (synthetic, [3/2] [UU_]).

